acceptance_criteria: No any casts remain in the extension definition path; activate is typed with the real ExtensionApi; Dependency on @unbrained/pm-cli stays type-only at runtime; typecheck and the full test suite pass
resolution: "Replaced the forced-any defineExtension shim with a locally declared identity helper constrained by the SDK ExtensionModule contract, and typed activate with the real ExtensionApi from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/authoring."
expected_result: "No any casts in the extension definition path, activate checked against the host contract, and the dependency on @unbrained/pm-cli kept type-only so no runtime module edge is added."
actual_result: typecheck clean and the full test suite passes; type imports erase at build time so the published extension carries no runtime edge to the CLI.
